//! Win32/OLE constants the ring references, GENERATED by scanning the SDK headers
//! (both `#define NAME <literal>` and C enum members `NAME = <literal>,` — the OLE
//! enums like TYMED/DVASPECT/MKSYS live in the widl-GENERATED headers under
//! build-<arch>/sdk/include/psdk, and com-sys's bindgen does not export them).
//!
//! Values are never hand-transcribed: a wrong clipboard-format or TYMED bit produces
//! no compile error, just silently wrong behavior at runtime. Regenerate, don't edit.
#![allow(clippy::all)]
